---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

import testFlowDashboard from "../../assets/projects/test-flow/dashboard.png";
import daleSkateHome from "../../assets/projects/dale-skate/home.png";
import devTrayckDashboard from "../../assets/projects/devtrayck/dashboard.png";
---

<section id="proyectos" class="section-spacing">
  <div class="page-container">
    <div class="mb-16 md:mb-24">
      <p
        class="mb-4 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-accent"
      >
        02 / Proyectos destacados
      </p>

      <h2
        class="max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-foreground sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl"
      >
        De la idea
        <span class="block text-muted">a producción.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-muted sm:text-lg">
        Una selección de proyectos en los que he participado desde la definición
        de la solución hasta su desarrollo, despliegue y evolución.
      </p>
    </div>

    <article class="border-t border-border pt-8">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-16">
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="mb-8 flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-sm font-medium text-muted"> 01 </span>

              <span
                class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted"
              >
                Proyecto profesional
              </span>
            </div>

            <h3
              class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-foreground md:text-5xl"
            >
              Test Flow
            </h3>

            <p class="mt-6 max-w-lg text-base leading-7 text-muted">
              Plataforma interna para centralizar y dar seguimiento al ciclo de
              pruebas de unidades en un entorno de manufactura, desde su
              registro hasta los procesos de diagnóstico, validación y
              liberación.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span
                class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-muted"
              >
                Django
              </span>

              <span
                class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-muted"
              >
                PostgreSQL
              </span>

              <span
                class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-muted"
              >
                JavaScript
              </span>

              <span
                class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-muted"
              >
                Tailwind CSS
              </span>

              <span
                class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-muted"
              >
                Nginx
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <a
            href="/proyectos/test-flow"
            class="group mt-10 inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-foreground transition-colors hover:text-accent"
          >
            Ver caso de estudio

            <span
              class="transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              →
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div
          class="group relative aspect-16/10 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-border bg-surface"
        >
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_70%_30%,rgb(0_217_255/10%),transparent_45%)]"
          >
          </div>

          <div
            class="absolute inset-6 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-background/80"
          >
            <div
              class="flex h-10 items-center gap-2 border-b border-border px-4"
            >
              <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-muted/30"></span>
              <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-muted/30"></span>
              <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-muted/30"></span>
            </div>

            <div class="relative h-[calc(100%-2.5rem)] overflow-hidden">
              <Image
                src={testFlowDashboard}
                alt="Dashboard principal de Test Flow con datos ficticios"
                class="h-full w-full object-cover object-top transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.02]"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="mt-28 border-t border-border pt-8 md:mt-36">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] lg:gap-16">
        <div
          class="group relative aspect-16/10 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-border bg-surface lg:order-1"
        >
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_30%_40%,rgb(0_217_255/8%),transparent_45%)]"
          >
          </div>

          <div
            class="absolute inset-6 rounded-xl border border-border bg-background/80"
          >
            <div
              class="flex h-10 items-center gap-2 border-b border-border px-4"
            >
              <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-muted/30"></span>
              <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-muted/30"></span>
              <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-muted/30"></span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex h-[calc(100%-2.5rem)] items-center justify-center">
              <div class="relative h-[calc(100%-2.5rem)] overflow-hidden">
                <Image
                  src={daleSkateHome}
                  alt="Página principal de Dale Skate"
                  class="h-full w-full object-cover object-top transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.02]"
                />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col justify-between lg:order-2">
          <div>
            <div class="mb-8 flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-sm font-medium text-muted"> 02 </span>

              <span
                class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted"
              >
                Proyecto para cliente
              </span>
            </div>

            <h3
              class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-foreground md:text-5xl"
            >
              Dale Skate
            </h3>

            <p class="mt-6 max-w-lg text-base leading-7 text-muted">
              Plataforma web para una revista mexicana de skateboarding,
              desarrollada para publicar y gestionar contenido editorial,
              fotografías, videos y artículos.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span
                class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-muted"
              >
                React
              </span>

              <span
                class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-muted"
              >
                PHP
              </span>

              <span
                class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-muted"
              >
                MySQL
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-6">
            <a
              href="/proyectos/dale-skate"
              class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-foreground transition-colors hover:text-accent"
            >
              Ver caso de estudio
              <span
                class="transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
              >
                →
              </span>
            </a>

            <a
              href="#"
              class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted transition-colors hover:text-foreground"
            >
              Sitio web
              <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <div
      class="mt-28 grid gap-6 border-t border-border pt-8 md:mt-36 md:grid-cols-2"
    >
      <article class="group">
        <div
          class="relative aspect-4/3 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-border bg-surface transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-accent/30"
        >
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_20%,rgb(0_217_255/8%),transparent_50%)]"
          >
          </div>

          <div
            class="absolute inset-6 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-background/80"
          >
            <div
              class="flex h-10 items-center gap-2 border-b border-border px-4"
            >
              <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-muted/30"></span>
              <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-muted/30"></span>
              <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-muted/30"></span>
            </div>

            <div class="relative h-[calc(100%-2.5rem)] overflow-hidden">
              <Image
                src={devTrayckDashboard}
                alt="Gestión de tareas de un proyecto en DevTrayck"
                class="h-full w-full object-cover object-top transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.02]"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <span class="text-sm text-muted">03</span>

            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted">
              Proyecto personal
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3
            class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground"
          >
            DevTrayck
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl leading-7 text-muted">
            Aplicación full-stack para organizar proyectos y tareas, con
            autenticación, API REST y despliegue independiente de frontend y
            backend.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span
              class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-muted"
            >
              React
            </span>

            <span
              class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-muted"
            >
              Django REST
            </span>

            <span
              class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-muted"
            >
              PostgreSQL
            </span>
          </div>

          <a
            href="/proyectos/devtrayck"
            class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-foreground transition-colors hover:text-accent"
          >
            Ver proyecto →
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="group">
        <div
          class="relative aspect-4/3 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-border bg-surface transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-accent/30"
        >
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_20%,rgb(0_217_255/8%),transparent_50%)]"
          >
          </div>

          <div
            class="absolute inset-6 flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-border bg-background/80"
          >
            <span class="text-sm text-muted"> Skatlas </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <span class="text-sm text-muted">04</span>

            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted">
              En desarrollo
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3
            class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground"
          >
            Skatlas
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl leading-7 text-muted">
            Plataforma para descubrir spots de skate y explorar lugares cercanos
            mediante ubicación, categorías y características del spot.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span
              class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-muted"
            >
              Laravel
            </span>

            <span
              class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-muted"
            >
              React
            </span>

            <span
              class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-muted"
            >
              PostgreSQL
            </span>

            <span
              class="rounded-full border border-border px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-muted"
            >
              Docker
            </span>
          </div>

          <a
            href="/proyectos/skatlas"
            class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-foreground transition-colors hover:text-accent"
          >
            Ver proyecto →
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
